  "narrative": {
    "text": "UML class diagram \"Harness schemas — attributes derived from JSON Schema\", in four packages. test: KG QA Report (kg-qa/v1; subject kind process|decision|role|requirement|skill|graph|tool, criteria, totals, pair_attestations) and Test Run (folio-test-run/v1; skill, subject, data and process hashes, outcome, cases). process: Task (process, task; BPMN callActivity, serviceTask, task and userTask) 'in process' Process (external OMG BPMN 2.0; start and end events, gateways, lanes, sequence flows) — noted as XSD, not JSON Schema. scenario: Actor (id, title, kind person|agent|system|external, roles) 'takes on roles' Role (persona, actorKinds, skills, inherits, actedUpon, judgementOnly); User Story (role, want, soThat) 'as a role'; Role 'carries skills' Skill (id, name, description, roles, requiredCapabilities, dependsOn, allowedTools, routingPatterns, tags, package, lifecycleStages plan|author|validate|review|test|publish|feedback|retire). schema: JSON Schema (draft-07, from Zod) and External Schema (authority OMG|DCMI|W3C|IETF|ISO|HL7|other; use conforms|reads|cites). Edges: KG QA Report audits subject kind; Test Run tests Skill; Task in lane of Role and uses Skill; every class conforms to JSON Schema.",
